  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut potato and beetroot into small cubes. Cut red onion into wedges. Thinly slice capsicum.\n• Divide veggies, garlic seasoning, a drizzle of olive oil and a pinch of salt and pepper between two lined oven trays. Toss to coat, spread in a single layer then roast until tender, 25-30 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61f24408d6fcba08846bf913/step-98493882.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop or crush garlic. Heat a drizzle of olive oil and garlic in a medium frying pan over medium-high heat, until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Transfer garlic oil to a small bowl. Stir in yoghurt. Season to taste. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61f24408d6fcba08846bf913/step-b6d98f7a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cut haloumi into 1cm slices and pat dry with paper towel. Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 2 mins each side. Remove pan from heat, add honey and turn to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61f24408d6fcba08846bf913/step-66155e3c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine balsamic vinegar and a drizzle of olive oil. Add roasted veggies and mixed salad leaves to dressing and toss to combine.\n• Divide between bowls and top with haloumi and garlic yoghurt to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61f24408d6fcba08846bf913/step-c899797a.jpg"
    }
  ]
